130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 459 0 R
/ActualText (The state road transport corporation \(SRTC\) is a criical component of public transportation infrastructure, providing connectivity across cities, towns, and rural areas. To enhance efficiency and provide better services, an automated Decision Support System \(DSS\) is envisioned. The first step in building this DSS is the creation of a robust, scalable, and well-structured database.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
131 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 460 0 R
/ActualText (This report outlines the design of the Entity-Relationship \(ER\) model, which will serve as the backbone for the database. The model incorporates various components, including corporations, routes, trips, stops, schedules, and fare systems. It ensures seamless integration of data to meet the demands of route optimization, scheduling, and cost-effective transportation management.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
132 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 461 0 R
/ActualText (The document includes detailed explanations of entities, relationships, assumptions, derived attributes, and their implementation in the database. The goal is to provide a blueprint that can be expanded to accommodate a national-level system for public transportation.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
133 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Assumptions)
/E (Assumptions)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
